* lna-a2-cascode-load: cascode PMOS load with inductive tuning for better stability and gain.
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
PMOS PM2 n3 n4 VDD VDD
L L2 n4 n5
C C2 n5 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n6
NMOS NM3 n6 n6 VSS VSS
R R2 n6 n1
PMOS PM4 n7 n7 VDD VDD
R R4 n7 VSS
R R5 n7 n3